# Input
```ts
/* should generate diagnostics */
import { defineComponent } from "vue";

export default defineComponent({
  render() {
    (this.$slots.foo as any).length;
    this.$slots.bar!.length;
  },
});

```

# Diagnostics
```
invalid.ts:6:18 lint/nursery/useVueSlotsAsFunctions ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × This slot is used as its content instead of being called.
  
    4 │ export default defineComponent({
    5 │   render() {
  > 6 │     (this.$slots.foo as any).length;
      │                  ^^^
    7 │     this.$slots.bar!.length;
    8 │   },
  
  i In Vue 3, each property of $slots is a function that returns the content of the slot, so reading or iterating it directly doesn't work.
  
  i Call the slot to get its content, for example this.$slots.default().
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

